## L6_1_ExactlyNinetyNinePointNineBreaksARun

L-6.1: a month at exactly 99.90% sits in the middle of four bad months and
defeats the consecutive trigger, because the run must be of three periods each
below 99.90%. The second trigger needs four failures and there are only three.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL6_1_ExactlyNinetyNinePointNineBreaksARun:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestL6_1_ExactlyNinetyNinePointNineBreaksARun:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-01-01|, |2025-01-31|, 98.00;
           mp of |2025-02-01|, |2025-02-28|, 99.90;
           mp of |2025-03-01|, |2025-03-31|, 98.00;
           mp of |2025-04-01|, |2025-04-30|, 98.00
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-05-15|
      -- notice_given: false
      -- notice_date: |2025-05-15|
    }
  assertion (number of r.failing_periods) = 3
  assertion r.consecutive_trigger = false
  assertion r.rolling_trigger = false
  assertion r.right_arisen = false
```

## L6_1_FourInTwelveMonthsWithoutThreeConsecutive

L-6.1 second trigger, standing alone. Four failing Measurement Periods inside
twelve months, alternating with good ones, so the first trigger is never
satisfied. The completing period is July, the fourth failure.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL6_1_FourInTwelveMonthsWithoutThreeConsecutive:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestL6_1_FourInTwelveMonthsWithoutThreeConsecutive:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-01-01|, |2025-01-31|, 99.50;
           mp of |2025-02-01|, |2025-02-28|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-03-01|, |2025-03-31|, 99.10;
           mp of |2025-04-01|, |2025-04-30|, 99.99;
           mp of |2025-05-01|, |2025-05-31|, 98.00;
           mp of |2025-06-01|, |2025-06-30|, 99.99;
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 97.00
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-08-15|
      -- notice_given: false
      -- notice_date: |2025-08-15|
    }
  assertion (number of r.failing_periods) = 4
  assertion r.consecutive_trigger = false
  assertion r.rolling_trigger = true
  assertion r.right_arisen = true
  assertion (number of r.completing_periods) = 1
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2025-07-31|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-08-30|
  assertion r.right_lapsed = false
  assertion r.right_exercisable = true
```

