## L6_1_BothTriggersAndTwoOccurrences

L-6.1: a history can complete the pattern more than once, and both triggers
can be satisfied. Six failures in two runs of three: March completes the first
consecutive run, September the second, and July, August and September each
complete a rolling four. L-6.2 assesses the earliest occurrence, March.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL6_1_BothTriggersAndTwoOccurrences:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestL6_1_BothTriggersAndTwoOccurrences:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-01-01|, |2025-01-31|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-02-01|, |2025-02-28|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-03-01|, |2025-03-31|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-04-01|, |2025-04-30|, 99.99;
           mp of |2025-05-01|, |2025-05-31|, 99.99;
           mp of |2025-06-01|, |2025-06-30|, 99.99;
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.00
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-04-20|
      -- notice_given: false
      -- notice_date: |2025-04-20|
    }
  assertion (number of r.failing_periods) = 6
  assertion r.consecutive_trigger = true
  assertion r.rolling_trigger = true
  assertion r.right_arisen = true
  assertion (number of r.completing_periods) = 4
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2025-03-31|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-04-30|
  assertion r.right_lapsed = false
  assertion r.right_exercisable = true
```

## L6_2_NoticeOnDayThirty

L-6.2: "within 30 days after the end of the Measurement Period which gives
rise to it" is inclusive of the thirtieth day. Notice on 30 April, from a
March trigger, is in time.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL6_2_NoticeOnDayThirty:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestL6_2_NoticeOnDayThirty:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-01-01|, |2025-01-31|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-02-01|, |2025-02-28|, 99.00;
           mp of |2025-03-01|, |2025-03-31|, 99.00
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-05-15|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-04-30|
    }
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-04-30|
  assertion r.right_lapsed = false
  assertion r.right_exercisable = true
```

