## CE0007_LapseOfOneOccurrenceLeavesTheNextIntact

L-6.2 lapses the right "in respect of that occurrence", which leaves every
later occurrence untouched. CE-0007's facts: three failing Measurement Periods
in early 2024, whose 30-day window closed unexercised on 30 April 2024,
fifteen months at the Service Level, then three more failing periods in July,
August and September 2025. Notice of termination was served on 5 October 2025
and the position is assessed on 10 October 2025. The occurrence live on that
date is the September 2025 one; its deadline is 30 October 2025, and notice
five days into the window is in time. Assessing the earliest occurrence
instead produced a deadline of 30 April 2024 and destroyed the 2025 right.

The two clusters are more than twelve months apart, so only the
three-consecutive-periods limb of L-6.1 is engaged.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCE0007_LapseOfOneOccurrenceLeavesTheNextIntact:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestCE0007_LapseOfOneOccurrenceLeavesTheNextIntact:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2024-01-01|, |2024-01-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-02-01|, |2024-02-29|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-03-01|, |2024-03-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-04-01|, |2024-04-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-05-01|, |2024-05-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-06-01|, |2024-06-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-07-01|, |2024-07-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-08-01|, |2024-08-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-09-01|, |2024-09-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-10-01|, |2024-10-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-11-01|, |2024-11-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2024-12-01|, |2024-12-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-01-01|, |2025-01-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-02-01|, |2025-02-28|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-03-01|, |2025-03-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-04-01|, |2025-04-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-05-01|, |2025-05-31|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-06-01|, |2025-06-30|, 99.95;
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-10-10|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-10-05|
    }
  assertion (number of r.failing_periods) = 6
  assertion r.consecutive_trigger = true
  assertion r.rolling_trigger = false
  assertion r.right_arisen = true
  assertion (number of r.completing_periods) = 2
  assertion (number of r.arisen_occurrences) = 2
  assertion (number of r.live_occurrences) = 1
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2025-09-30|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-10-30|
  assertion r.notice_exercises_the_right = true
  assertion r.right_lapsed = false
  assertion r.right_exercisable = true
```

## CE0007_ALiveEarlierOccurrenceIsNotDisplacedByALaterOne

The converse of the same rule. On the same history assessed on 20 April 2024,
the only occurrence that has arisen is the March 2024 one — the 2025 periods
had not ended — and its window is still open, so it is the occurrence
assessed. A later completing period in the record does not take the
assessment away from an occurrence that is live.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCE0007_ALiveEarlierOccurrenceIsNotDisplacedByALaterOne:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestCE0007_ALiveEarlierOccurrenceIsNotDisplacedByALaterOne:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2024-01-01|, |2024-01-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-02-01|, |2024-02-29|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-03-01|, |2024-03-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2024-04-20|
      -- notice_given: false
      -- notice_date: |2024-04-20|
    }
  assertion (number of r.completing_periods) = 2
  assertion (number of r.arisen_occurrences) = 1
  assertion (number of r.live_occurrences) = 1
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2024-03-31|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2024-04-30|
  assertion r.right_lapsed = false
  assertion r.right_exercisable = true
```

## CE0007_WhereEveryWindowHasClosedTheLatestOccurrenceGovernsTheLapse

Where no occurrence is live the latest one to have arisen governs, so the
lapse is reported against the occurrence it actually belongs to rather than
against the oldest failure in the record. The same two clusters, assessed on
1 December 2025 with no notice ever served: the September 2025 window closed
on 30 October 2025 and the right has lapsed in respect of that occurrence.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCE0007_WhereEveryWindowHasClosedTheLatestOccurrenceGovernsTheLapse:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestCE0007_WhereEveryWindowHasClosedTheLatestOccurrenceGovernsTheLapse:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2024-01-01|, |2024-01-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-02-01|, |2024-02-29|, 99.80;
           mp of |2024-03-01|, |2024-03-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-12-01|
      -- notice_given: false
      -- notice_date: |2025-12-01|
    }
  assertion (number of r.arisen_occurrences) = 2
  assertion (number of r.live_occurrences) = 0
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2025-09-30|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-10-30|
  assertion r.right_lapsed = true
  assertion r.right_exercisable = false
```

## CE0008_NoticeBeforeTheRightAroseDoesNotExerciseIt

CE-0008's facts. The Availability Percentage was below 99.90% in July, August
and September 2025, so the right arose on the expiry of September 2025. The
only notice ever served was dated 15 August 2025, in the middle of the failing
run, before the third consecutive period had ended and therefore before any
right existed. Nothing was served in the window, so on an assessment made on
1 December 2025 — after the window closed on 30 October 2025 — the right has
lapsed. Testing only the upper bound of the window treated that notice as a
good exercise and reported the right as exercisable indefinitely.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCE0008_NoticeBeforeTheRightAroseDoesNotExerciseIt:
  output r content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestCE0008_NoticeBeforeTheRightAroseDoesNotExerciseIt:
  definition r equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-12-01|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-08-15|
    }
  assertion r.right_arisen = true
  assertion r.trigger_period_end = Present content |2025-09-30|
  assertion r.exercise_deadline = Present content |2025-10-30|
  assertion r.notice_exercises_the_right = false
  assertion r.right_lapsed = true
  assertion r.right_exercisable = false
```

## CE0008_TheWindowOpensWhenTheTriggeringPeriodEnds

The lower bound of the L-6.2 window, tested on both sides. The right is
conferred by L-6.1 only on the expiry of the third failing Measurement Period,
so a notice dated 30 September 2025 — the last day of that period — is not
given "after the end" of it and exercises nothing; a notice dated 1 October
2025 is day one of the thirty and is good. A premature notice does not lapse
the right while the window is still open: the right simply remains
unexercised, and lapses only once the window closes.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCE0008_TheWindowOpensWhenTheTriggeringPeriodEnds:
  output on_the_period_end content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight
  output on_day_one content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight
  output premature_and_window_closed content ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight

scope TestCE0008_TheWindowOpensWhenTheTriggeringPeriodEnds:
  definition on_the_period_end equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-10-15|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-09-30|
    }
  definition on_day_one equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-10-15|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-10-01|
    }
  definition premature_and_window_closed equals
    output of ChronicFailure.ChronicFailureRight with {
      -- availability_history: [
           mp of |2025-07-01|, |2025-07-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-08-01|, |2025-08-31|, 99.80;
           mp of |2025-09-01|, |2025-09-30|, 99.80
         ]
      -- assessment_date: |2025-11-01|
      -- notice_given: true
      -- notice_date: |2025-09-30|
    }
  assertion on_the_period_end.notice_exercises_the_right = false
  assertion on_the_period_end.right_lapsed = false
  assertion on_the_period_end.right_exercisable = true
  assertion on_day_one.notice_exercises_the_right = true
  assertion on_day_one.right_lapsed = false
  assertion on_day_one.right_exercisable = true
  assertion premature_and_window_closed.notice_exercises_the_right = false
  assertion premature_and_window_closed.right_lapsed = true
  assertion premature_and_window_closed.right_exercisable = false
```
